  "prefLabel": "Lot 4001.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 4001.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish registration requirements for Fantasy sports contest operators offering fantasy sports contests with an entry fee in the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #12479, eff 2-15-18",
